Subject: [PATCH 2/6] PF-CAP-10: adatta il test PR28-d sul cap persistito vuoto
 alla semantica opzionale

test_blank_persisted_absolute_cap_stays_configured_and_fails_closed
assumeva "vuoto != opt-out" (NaN). Con la rettifica owner 18/10/2026 un
valore vuoto/assente e' None = non attivo; resta fail-closed il valore
presente ma illeggibile (testo => NaN => `<nome>_non_valido`). Rinominato in
test_blank_persisted_absolute_cap_is_not_active_but_unreadable_fails_closed.
Tutti gli altri test PR28-d (cap configurati esplicitamente) invariati.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Wrefu68dTUWD1PXe8PTZjb
---
 tests/acceptance/test_issue437_pr28d.py | 19 ++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/acceptance/test_issue437_pr28d.py b/tests/acceptance/test_issue437_pr28d.py
index 5d45118..d659f15 100644
--- a/tests/acceptance/test_issue437_pr28d.py
+++ b/tests/acceptance/test_issue437_pr28d.py
@@ -239,19 +239,28 @@ def test_telegram_event_id_alias_reaches_runtime_event_cap(tmp_path):
     "max_order_exposure", "max_market_exposure", "max_event_exposure_abs",
     "max_drawdown_abs",
 ])
-def test_blank_persisted_absolute_cap_stays_configured_and_fails_closed(field):
+def test_blank_persisted_absolute_cap_is_not_active_but_unreadable_fails_closed(field):
+    """Rettifica owner 18/10/2026: i cap assoluti sono opzionali.
+
+    Vuoto/assente => None (non attivo, nessun default numerico); presente ma
+    illeggibile => NaN, che il runtime nega come `<nome>_non_valido`."""
     key = f"roserpina.{field}"
 
     class _Db:
+        def __init__(self, raw):
+            self._raw = raw
+
         def get_settings(self):
-            return {key: ""}
+            return {key: self._raw}
 
         def get_all_settings(self):
             return self.get_settings()
 
-    value = getattr(SettingsService(_Db()).load_roserpina_config(), field)
-    assert validators.finite_number(value) is None
-    assert value is not None
+    assert getattr(SettingsService(_Db("")).load_roserpina_config(), field) is None
+
+    unreadable = getattr(SettingsService(_Db("dieci euro")).load_roserpina_config(), field)
+    assert unreadable is not None
+    assert validators.finite_number(unreadable) is None
 
 
